	WASHINGTON, DC  Congresswomen Jackie Speier (D-San Francisco/San Mateo/Redwood City) issued the following statement after sexual assault charges against Army Brig. Gen. Jeffrey Sinclair were dropped. Sinclair initially faced a 26-count indictment but will plead guilty to remaining lesser charges, including mistreatment of his accuser  an infraction unique to the Uniform Code of Military Justice.



